        <h1 id="post-title">拔智齿的经历</h1>
        <p>拔智齿的全过程记录：拍片、付费、麻醉、手术，以及术后一周的恢复经验</p>
      </header>

      <figure class="article-cover">
        <img
          src="/_astro/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jul%2020_%202026_%2005_29_43%20PM-thumb.DmWba74d.avif"
