              <td data-comment-block-id="cb-wt-cost-td10">980.00</td>
              <td data-comment-block-id="cb-wt-cost-td11">统筹 + 个人账户</td>
              <td data-comment-block-id="cb-wt-cost-td12">含切开缝合及微创器械耗材</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td data-comment-block-id="cb-wt-cost-td13">术后药品（布洛芬 + 头孢）</td>
              <td data-comment-block-id="cb-wt-cost-td14">72.00</td>
              <td data-comment-block-id="cb-wt-cost-td15">个人账户支付</td>
